#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:4
msgid "v4.1.8"
msgstr "v4.1.8"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.1.8 is a maintenance release that bundles OpenMV firmware and examples "
"v4.5.5 and fixes the ``FORCE_FULL_SCREEN`` build configuration. It remains "
"based on Qt Creator 10.0.1, and there are no breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"La version v4.1.8 est une version de maintenance qui embarque le "
"micrologiciel et les exemples OpenMV v4.5.5 et corrige la configuration de "
"compilation ``FORCE_FULL_SCREEN``. Elle reste basée sur Qt Creator 10.0.1, "
"et il n'y a aucun changement incompatible."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:13
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Sur cette page"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:16
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Points forts"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Bundled firmware v4.5.5** for all supported OpenMV and Arduino boards, "
"with refreshed firmware, bootloader, and UVC binaries."
msgstr ""
"**Micrologiciel fourni v4.5.5** pour toutes les cartes OpenMV et Arduino "
"prises en charge, avec des binaires de micrologiciel, de programme "
"d'amorçage et UVC actualisés."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Updated example scripts** migrated to the new image hint API and the new "
"``img.to_jpeg()`` JPEG API."
msgstr ""
"**Scripts d'exemple mis à jour** migrés vers la nouvelle API d'indication "
"d'image et la nouvelle API JPEG ``img.to_jpeg()``."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:22
msgid ""
"**FORCE_FULL_SCREEN fix** so the forced-fullscreen build now compiles and "
"runs correctly."
msgstr ""
"**Correction FORCE_FULL_SCREEN** afin que la compilation en plein écran "
"forcé se compile et s'exécute désormais correctement."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:26
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Autres changements et améliorations"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:28
msgid ""
"Bundled OpenMV firmware and examples updated to **v4.5.5** across all boards"
" (OpenMV M2/M3/H7/H7 Plus/PT/RT1060, Arduino Giga/Portenta H7/Nicla "
"Vision/Nano RP2040 Connect/Nano 33 BLE Sense), including refreshed "
"firmware/bootloader/UVC binaries. Example scripts were migrated to the new "
"image hint API (used by ``image.scale()``, ``to_rainbow()``, ``to_jpeg()``, "
"etc.) with constants such as ``image.AREA``, ``image.ROTATE_180``, and "
"``image.VFLIP``/``HMIRROR``/``TRANSPOSE``, replacing ``mean_pooled()``, "
"``replace()``, and ``assign()``. The examples also migrated the deprecated "
"JPEG API, replacing ``img.compress()`` and ``frame.compressed()`` with "
"``img.to_jpeg()`` and ``to_jpeg(copy=True)`` across the Time-of-Flight, "
"thermal, RPC remote-control, MJPEG streamer, and board ``usb_vcp.py`` "
"examples (`0604d5284 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/0604d5284>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Le micrologiciel et les exemples OpenMV fournis ont été mis à jour vers la "
"**v4.5.5** sur l'ensemble des cartes (OpenMV M2/M3/H7/H7 Plus/PT/RT1060, "
"Arduino Giga/Portenta H7/Nicla Vision/Nano RP2040 Connect/Nano 33 BLE "
"Sense), y compris les binaires de micrologiciel/programme d'amorçage/UVC "
"actualisés. Les scripts d'exemple ont été migrés vers la nouvelle API "
"d'indication d'image (utilisée par ``image.scale()``, ``to_rainbow()``, "
"``to_jpeg()``, etc.) avec des constantes telles que ``image.AREA``, "
"``image.ROTATE_180`` et ``image.VFLIP``/``HMIRROR``/``TRANSPOSE``, "
"remplaçant ``mean_pooled()``, ``replace()`` et ``assign()``. Les exemples "
"ont aussi migré l'API JPEG obsolète, remplaçant ``img.compress()`` et "
"``frame.compressed()`` par ``img.to_jpeg()`` et ``to_jpeg(copy=True)`` dans "
"les exemples Time-of-Flight, thermique, RPC remote-control, MJPEG streamer "
"et ``usb_vcp.py`` de carte (`0604d5284 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/0604d5284>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:43
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Corrections de bogues"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:45
msgid ""
"Fixed the ``FORCE_FULL_SCREEN`` build configuration so the forced-fullscreen"
" code block compiles and runs correctly by moving the opening brace outside "
"the preprocessor ``#else``/``#endif`` guard, ensuring both the "
"``FORCE_FULL_SCREEN`` and ``-full_screen`` argument paths share the same "
"block (`4354cf8f4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4354cf8f4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Correction de la configuration de compilation ``FORCE_FULL_SCREEN`` afin que"
" le bloc de code en plein écran forcé se compile et s'exécute correctement "
"en déplaçant l'accolade ouvrante hors de la protection de préprocesseur "
"``#else``/``#endif``, garantissant que les chemins d'argument "
"``FORCE_FULL_SCREEN`` et ``-full_screen`` partagent le même bloc (`4354cf8f4"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4354cf8f4>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:53
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Prise en charge des plateformes et des outils"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:55
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 10.0.1."
msgstr "**Base Qt Creator :** 10.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:56
msgid "**Bundled firmware and examples:** updated to v4.5.5 (from v4.5.4)."
msgstr ""
"**Micrologiciel et exemples fournis :** mis à jour vers la v4.5.5 (depuis la"
" v4.5.4)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:59
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Changements incompatibles"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.8.rst:61
msgid ""
"None. This release bundles new firmware and a build fix; existing IDE "
"projects and workflows are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Aucun. Cette version embarque un nouveau micrologiciel et une correction de "
"compilation ; les projets et flux de travail IDE existants ne sont pas "
"affectés."
